e judge me, criticize, but I don't mind"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "I'm free, I'm me, that's my wealth, refined"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So let me shine, despite the visible seams"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "I'm a star, unique in this wild galaxy, it seems"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "And if you want to join me, in this world of glee"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Come along, hide under your own sketched seams with me"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[ outro ]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}